   "text": "LOS 5 ENLACES\n\n① shell → ControlNode\n    gRPC unario\n    rutas, bloques, locks, op_id\n\n② shell → DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    bloques o rangos, de 1 MiB en 1 MiB\n\n③ ControlNode ↔ ControlNode\n    TCP de pysyncobj (Raft)\n\n④ ControlNode → DataNode\n    gRPC · Ping, ReplicateBlock,\n    ListStoredBlocks, DeleteBlock\n\n⑤ DataNode → DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    (pipeline y re-replicación)",
   "originalText": "LOS 5 ENLACES\n\n① shell → ControlNode\n    gRPC unario\n    rutas, bloques, locks, op_id\n\n② shell → DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    bloques o rangos, de 1 MiB en 1 MiB\n\n③ ControlNode ↔ ControlNode\n    TCP de pysyncobj (Raft)\n\n④ ControlNode → DataNode\n    gRPC · Ping, ReplicateBlock,\n    ListStoredBlocks, DeleteBlock\n\n⑤ DataNode → DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    (pipeline y re-replicación)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "c90_6415",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0092",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1470956926,
